Terms of Service — Word Alert Bot
Effective date: October 7, 2026

Word Alert Bot watches messages in one configured Discord channel for a
specified word. When it finds a match, it replies with a mention of the
configured user.

Use the bot only in servers and channels where you have permission to add
or use it. Do not use the bot to harass, spam, or disrupt other users.
Use of Discord remains subject to Discord’s Terms of Service and Community
Guidelines.

The bot is provided as-is and may be changed, paused, or discontinued at
any time. The bot operator is not responsible for missed alerts, delays,
or interruptions.
